              "recommended_next_step": "Monitor the pgbouncer connection pool and ensure the jobs are running successfully. Schedule regular maintenance to prevent future issues.",
              "summary": "Investigated the root cause of 502 errors and identified the issue with pgbouncer connection pool exhaustion. Restarted the pgbouncer service in prod, cleared the connection pool. Also, examined the failed_jobs table and deleted failed jobs. The table was exported for the postmortem."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
